// Clue Name :
"P3777817232" "Modified Computer Files"
// DetailString :
"P1838186261" "You successfully modified the data files so that they no longer blindly support Emperor Cole, but instead offer support to the Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2677694996" "I can't believe the drivel these propaganda punks are spoon feeding the people! This has got to stop, luckily the less 'fanatic' members of the Resistance agree with me. What do you say, {HeroName}, can you help me put out the real message?"
// SendOffString :
"P2454050907" "That's what I like to hear. Someone with the drive to do the right thing... Even if it is, by definition, rather illegal. History will remember you as courageous for standing against the lies and doing what you could to make sure the truth got out there.<br><br>Athena Labs supplies the network with all of their 'Cole Approved' data diskettes. As far as I can tell, once Athena Labs approved the diskettes, they go straight to the network and are uploaded into the news bulletin. If you could modify those files, we just might get a positive message out for the Resistance, and uncover just how fake the news really is."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3655078472" "Get information"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P515676385" "You still need to get that thing for me."

