// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL2.5_IC_Flores_R_Task3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ColumnistClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P144398055" "Jason Maxwell"
// DetailString :
"P3613710085" "Jason Maxwell is a well respected columnist for TPN. His sudden shift to support the resistance in his column is refreshing, but dangerous."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EditorClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3983536527" "Kenneth Hall"
// DetailString :
"P1017921321" "As editor in chief of TPN Today, Mr. Hall is entrusted with keeping the government agenda and ensuring that anti-government drivel is kept out of his columns. His decision to betray that trust means he needs to disappear."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ComputerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2731680375" "Main Server"
// DetailString :
"P4150944138" "Kenneth Hall informed you that he was stopped by the PPD before he could upload the column to the TPN Today main server. You need to finish the upload so that the column can get out to the public."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P303459449" "You know Jason Maxwell? Yeah, the columnist who has sparked all the controversy over at TPN Today for his borderline Pro-Resistance articles. Well he is a member of the Resistance... He's also my boyfriend.<br><br>He's done something incredibly dumb, and he's going to get himself killed unless you help him. Please {HeroName}, I got him into the Resistance, if anything happened to him I'd feel personally responsible."
// SendOffString :
"P2210801234" "Thank you. Listen. He and Kenneth Hall, the chief editor, are at the TPN Campus right now. Jason told me that Kenneth is a Resistance member also, and they decided to push through a Pro-Resistance article into today's edition of the 'zine.<br><br>The second that article is read both Kenneth and Jason will be wanted men. They were supposed to be out by now, but I haven't heard a word from them and it looks like TPN Today has heightened their security in the last couple minutes. I'm scared."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P539407786" "Rescue Media Commentators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3238056941" "You need to rescue them, I'm sure they are in danger!"

